WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.975
You changed nothing a sighted reader will ever notice.

00:00:04.975 --> 00:00:09.950
Order restored, headings made real, links given names.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:13.727
Tell me what you gave this document back.

00:00:13.727 --> 00:00:17.136
One word, and the wing returns to me.
